  "limitations": [
    "function coverage is written by node itself to NODE_V8_COVERAGE",
    "--capture heap enables the inspector Debugger domain for the run to record script ids; scripts.json is informational (no dla adapter reads it, snapshots name their scripts), and the Debugger adds some overhead",
    "--capture nonheap tracks resources with async_hooks (init and destroy), which makes promise-heavy targets run up to roughly 10x slower than without the capture; compare timings only between runs that use the same capture",
    "timer and listener counts cover registrations made through the global/`timers` functions and EventEmitter/EventTarget methods; timers/promises and internal timers are not counted"
  ]
